    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb9ae81992e1727569296b46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今朝もヨーグルト食べてきたぞ！\r\nにしても…あんなに美味しいものが\r\n牛乳からできてるなんて…複雑だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da03b20ec56164e11bc1ea24f8d9292c008fbdb5d6d4e5f692aa617a860ea656",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97fc6e5f6330596a08d109e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学食のカレーってすごく辛いんだ！\r\nキャロットマンカレーよりもだぞ。\r\nみんなは平気っぽいけど…むむむ…",
      "source_fingerprint": "b87d9052fc2f617ceb68a941276e496313ac7d0f6a4cf6362c1a1d55a0742b7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32e6c7ab40b3037f750fe02b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "らんらんら～♪らららんら～っ♪\r\nよーし！このままスキップで外に\r\n行くぞ！校庭で思い切り遊ぶんだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9fc08c2209f2ec62e05889690cfc468cb964732f161ab0430a837e753e3b1b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:180b0e698e33abaf3127132d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふわあぁ～、エネルギー切れが…\r\nヒーローは…1日に戦える時間が…\r\n決まってる…から…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70128b41f39ae4d2d82df883bbe958471c44436669c47b22f25771b41fc6b347",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:679bee2a09596388a0dcc6cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "――今日も平和な1日が守られた。\r\nだが、正義の戦いは明日も続く…！\r\nへへっ！おやすみ前の次回予告だ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb0d9c73f7478f9006da23c1ade925bc68824d46da6f4380c7fd1171a0bb39c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4299d88a9c1d091f72e954ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『春は交番が忙しくなる』って\r\nお父ちゃんが言ってたんだ！学園の\r\nパトロールも強化しなきゃな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e78e32db898d160205f2536f0b8f4eec458f28a455e7b768432e6a4a5b3a5fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b9c6fc25488b5d5c3afec2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏といえば、そう『夏映画』だっ！\r\n今年もヒーローたちが大集合だぞ！\r\nうおおお～～！熱すぎるーーっ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9012caeb5bb9fcf8f6903053268acfd84e5a73b4268fba3e9c6adc5e3493217",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9863d8c1f02674caff732e58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『食欲の秋』のアタシはすごいぞ！\r\nなんと…！お昼に毎回デザートを\r\nつけちゃうんだ！大食いだろ～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "615d1b0c2a1867423bfabfad1880e04de8c9ae813a4b51a1c55eab16999e75d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:616459fed1ca69b609de2dce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "寒くても元気をなくしちゃダメだ！\r\nファンのちびっ子たちのお手本に\r\nなれるよう、シャキッとしないと！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9041c6562d864a4706df70cad232c292b64f574c162d93a758299425a7bd05d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26a0cf5c6244cb9771b596a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッピーバレンタイン！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce6d8d9eca19623907ad62c3fee5b746e2a7886cd999191715aceca42bf64b29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b21890aa174c670d09928bcc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ボノは高いとこに手が届くだろ？\r\nアタシはベッドの下に潜れるだろ？\r\n寮の部屋の収納は、そんな感じだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cdacb632db1be52677cfcf9020fc373934c2e7a75741e8dc8f5c752bfcd33de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8168c7a3d3d62c21ad6f9867",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヒシアマ姐さんのアップルパイは\r\nすっごく美味しいんだぞ！アタシも\r\nお手伝いしてよく一緒に作るんだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3332700247a2e26d60f9e3bc92c0ffde9770eefca6b14994218feabdcac7f1f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5913130e44a57a5e8bb12e8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アタシもバクシンオー先輩を\r\n見習って優等生になる！ペガサス！\r\nペガサス！ペガサスサーース！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec3967601079d72829b3126fbdd7c2b4a3b6892eb1b575d1193035da93098b10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37cbb180a68381613ad87983",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お父ちゃんは超強い警察官だけど、\r\n非番の日は全然そうは見えない…。\r\nヒーローって、普段は平凡なんだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e6703c3610024f8b1754526fdb97fc3380b32fa1a22fabfa0982325c80c7afe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52db5260e227ae9086152807",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "美容院ってドキドキするよな？\r\n耳元でハサミの音がして…ううぅ！\r\n目をつむって歌えば大丈夫だけど…",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dfb68b08c0c2eb046178e1ba6bd524cda86cad516266e19a57d694b64a55722",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56dfec590e05e6e53df21d44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ライブパフォーマンスはまかせろ！\r\nヒーローショーみたく、じゃーん！\r\nばばーん！ってしてやる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27797e371df6f3b3bd9bae8d371e68619a9b8a9332ae21f8ed341f0fce27a4e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7372e19d692aa72f0a67c3cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "説明しようっ！この衣装を着ると\r\n団結力がアップし、超パワーの\r\nダンスができるのであ～る！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb314911707f12a234fa3ea46c94f4d8c57daa555fa2c3464899e6ab3ba819d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9aea99f39d258f63be45a848",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "レースで仮面は被らないけど…\r\n実はあるんだぞ！デザイナーさんが\r\nサービスで作ってくれたんだっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "57345e7be6c21b5c2853be09e92d78c25ae4b3c13b99ab8932a0591ee4bfb6f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4279546c3af9d09cd3bd7ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヒーロースーツっていうのは、\r\n世界に1つの大事な相棒なんだ！\r\nこれがあるから、戦えるっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b513437a95509ce60010b10a200a9ac9b179fa600400daa7d0fa4e7f64b4965",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fcd8eb08ac8a54c3388856c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アタシの早起きルーチン動画はな、\r\n子どもに見せると飛び起きるって\r\n親御さんたちからも好評なんだー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fe201db1ae79e116750bd8c76eea505aee1ca6c02a7de468300da9a1fef0696",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:576da5d1d1aaef77b09575ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昼時って…うとうと、する…な…\r\nんん～～～…――はっ…！\r\nま、負けないぞお…睡魔マンめ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d436c47b05385270bc13d104fc3a1fa201075234010195938ec30721f8adbf72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2bbfb253f18d05c05c42890",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今、窓の外に謎の影が…？\r\n怪獣かっ！？――いや、おばけ…？\r\nだ、大丈夫！アタシに任せとけ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fddc94abd4cac9b133f53283e4b190eb6bbaab38bb0435d1140a901ccbd89647",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fecea12fd49708c734d94a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この時期は、よく新入生に\r\n間違われるけど…それがきっかけで\r\n仲良くなれたりするんだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "31434a844107f218e9c72642e37ad36e70906d61c9f750e3bdfcaaef1dfaa572",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d61f05485389e09ec8873528",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "暑くて食欲がなくなりそうな日も、\r\nボノの特別メニューがあるから\r\n夏バテ知らずなんだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97d6e64c25f058fcdfe33aef12d10ca4e6b28b0aa6312338798a2e30c8242444",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2c0e403eeaada33aaa44da6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近、落ち葉にキックして\r\n動体視力を鍛えてるんだ！\r\nオマエも一緒にやるか！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f88f25044a896dfa9869083ff10118540be0009e96369fee683d1c547964446",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd2365229235c92fbb07767d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "こないだみんなで雪合戦したんだ！\r\nペガサス・アイスショットを\r\n日が暮れるまで打ちまくったぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0de0cbd1bcdf65bfcfe1e3a56765c5be154dc6ec398164be07348e89b1d7bd6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a67ab2acd3177f45336d4e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アタシががんばる姿で\r\nちびっ子たちに伝えるんだ！\r\n諦めない心が大事だ、ってな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b31848dd0cf0fc5158c52cc15915c4c06cdb0fb571a01c2bc55d1823fdbde602",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:499f02c1c00935f391506c09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よっし！",
      "source_fingerprint": "233fde9a92e38db53bd39f716b0a8b1831951d288a6c23df387a58e7eebc5569",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:347ce32e15fccc1d9e52fea7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『準備完了！カロテンMAX！\r\nジャスティス・ビコー、出動ー！』",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ac27197e98a3baf8d5c9d8a14b3af20c1b0fff9af527a023df602e5a5467404",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d53045f4fcf12e14a14222e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ピコン、ピコン…！大変だっ！\r\n早く指示をくれないと…\r\nアタシのウズウズが爆発するぞっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93368ca557dfa31ec0aeff21664b993821f6bf61b7cf862e63a364a131fdb8d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3384f10d4712525397efe18b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあ、行くぞっ！\r\nペガサスが空を駆けるみたいに、\r\nアタシもビューンって走るんだっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcd8ad7830d3baad844c2ee73a0e8beb96e90fd797995001f26b010ed49b9773",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87ba7a86280ab8e4efb54646",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『正義の翼で悪を差し！\r\n駆けて羽ばたけ、世界を救え！』\r\nうおぉーっ！燃えてきた～～っ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc21a598f27ef2c674a230ab97e535baae6c67a3f9cda72d18373418b4919fb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:595e65797297985ce0b6252a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナー、今日も共に戦うぞ！\r\n最強タッグでフルパワーだ！\r\nはあっ！ダブルアターック！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8264a8c4f86c1caca0337898a14df82e23233d024d4ebb62cac065c9b45fa437",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:628ecdac39bccb6dfb0c6689",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "オマエがいると勇気が湧いてくる。\r\n予感がするんだ、\r\n本当のヒーローになれるって…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5b79241204fbc1c8734c04e2461b73307bbd9cd87c4e2aca09b5176dbecd908",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "92007"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
